    {"id":"rulestext","type":"text","x":85,"y":838,"width":1010,"height":85,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"opacity":100,"seed":12,"version":1,"versionNonce":12,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1786838400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Delegacion permitida:\n1. orchestrator -> agentes de fase.  2. planner -> api-designer, database-expert, ux-designer, research-analyst, architect.\n3. implementer -> backend-expert, frontend-expert, database-expert, test-engineer, refactor-specialist, api-designer.\nLos otros 17 agentes no delegan. Los especialistas hacen HANDOFF al invocador; los hallazgos vuelven a la fase que los resuelve.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"rules","originalText":"Delegacion permitida:\n1. orchestrator -> agentes de fase.  2. planner -> api-designer, database-expert, ux-designer, research-analyst, architect.\n3. implementer -> backend-expert, frontend-expert, database-expert, test-engineer, refactor-specialist, api-designer.\nLos otros 17 agentes no delegan. Los especialistas hacen HANDOFF al invocador; los hallazgos vuelven a la fase que los resuelve.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},
